<span id="S8.T5.3.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.T5.3.1.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Environmental Configuration Instruction<span id="S8.T5.3.1.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: In the upper left of the mountainous terrain, amidst the rain and mist of an autumn afternoon, three ancient warriors patrol the rugged landscape. Their vigilant presence contrasts with the serene middle left, where five sheep are grazing peacefully. The scene captures the realism of a world where ancient and pastoral life coexist, surrounded by the dense forests and the significant body of water noticeable towards the lower left.</span></span></span>
